{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>ויצר לו</b> This word is of the heavy paradigm, like \"והצר לך\" (Deuteronomy 28:53)." "<b>ויחץ.</b> The yod opened [with patach] on account of the weak letter that comes after it, like \"וַיַעַל משה\" (Exodus 19:20)."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {0 "Citation in the Hebrew reads 'דבר כח נב' which resolves to Deuteronomy 28:53; the letters כח (28) and נב (52) appear to be two variant forms of the chapter number, one in error.", 1 "Reading 'אות הנרו' as 'אות הנרפה' (weak letter); the Hebrew as given may reflect scribal abbreviation or corruption."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:46:47.978194060Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}